post.description:
API keys: `machines:write` (or the legacy `machines:exec`), a key of this org (a workspace key is its admin).
Only while the workspace is paused for a failed payment or disabled (its subscription ended), until its data is deleted (`Org.purgeAt`);
an active workspace answers `409 operation_conflict`. The owner and admins export any sandbox or snapshot of
the workspace, a member the ones they own. The server builds a `.tar.gz` of the disk from its saved copy,
with no sandbox started. A source with a queued, building or ready export returns that export (200);
otherwise a new one is queued (202). Poll `GET /v1/exports/{id}` until it is `ready`.
